# ---------- Bloodsail camp south of Booty Bay ----------
C 604,587 @ Stranglethorn Vale, 29.0, 82.4 | The Bloodsail camp on the shore just south of Booty Bay: kill 10 Swashbucklers and pick up the Bloodsail Charts and Orders lying in the camp. Snuff drops from any Bloodsail pirate. Dizzy's Eye (576) drops only rarely from any Bloodsail, including the ship crews you fight later, so loot everything. One group at a time; Earth Shock the Warlocks' Shadow Bolts
T 604 | Fleet Master Seahorn
A 608 | Keep it for the end of the jungle loop
