FLY Grom'gol | Gringer, Booty Bay's wind rider master
A 572 | Far Seer Mok'thardin. The Jungle Stalkers for it come later in this segment
C 584 | 584 is already in your log. Ride north-west to the Ruins of Zul'Kunda: Gan'zulah (41) and Nezzliok the Dire (40) stand inside the ruins among Bloodscalp trolls. Clear around each one first, then kill them for their heads
A 196 @ Stranglethorn Vale, 35.7, 10.8 | Hemet Nesingwary, a short ride east of Zul'Kunda at the hunters' camp
