# ---------- The Skullsplitter ruins ----------
C 585 | Ride east to the Skullsplitter ruins and click the trophy skull piles at Ziata'jai (42, 36), Balia'mah (46, 32) and Zul'Mamwe (48, 40)
C 586,209,598 | Skullsplitter Hunters, Headhunters and Berserkers (41-44) hold Zul'Mamwe, the south-east ruin; Ana'thek the Cruel (45) walks there and drops the armour. Tusks and necklaces drop from every Skullsplitter, but slowly: the Warriors, Axe Throwers and Mystics (39-40) in the other two ruins die fastest. Earth Shock the Witch Doctors' and Mystics' heals
T 585,586 | Ride back west to Grom'gol: the Bubbling Cauldron
A 588 | The cauldron again
T 598,588 | Kin'weelay
