# ---------- Central Stranglethorn: Venture Co., basilisks, Zanzil and the Jungle Stalkers ----------
C 600,589 @ Stranglethorn Vale, 42.5, 45.5 | Ride back east, past the ruins, to the Venture Co. camp at the Crystalvein Mine. Strip Miners, Tinkerers and Surveyors (40-42) drop Singing Blue Crystals on most kills. Ironjaw Basilisks (43-44) in and around the mine, just south of the camp, drop the Pulsing Blue Shards
C 621,609 | Ride south-west to Zanzil's camp (37-40, 52-59). His trolls, zombies and naga (43-44) drop Zanzil's Mixture on about 1 in 3 kills, and Chucky "Ten Thumbs" (43, at 40, 58) has the ring: Zanzil himself (46) stands beside him, so pull Chucky away first. Maury "Club Foot" Wilkins and Jon-Jon the Crow (43-44) stand together at the ruins on the north-west edge (35, 51): kill both. Earth Shock the Witch Doctors
C 572,196 @ Stranglethorn Vale, 28.5, 46.0 | Jungle Stalkers (40-41), the raptors in the jungle west of Maury's ruins toward the coast. Kill 10 for Hemet; about 1 in 4 drops a feather for Mok'thardin, so keep going until you have 10. They come in pairs: Stoneclaw Totem holds the second one
T 589 | Ride north to Grom'gol: Kin'weelay. Skip the next part (The Mind's Eye, elite)
T 572 | Far Seer Mok'thardin. Skip his next quest (571): its Aged Gorilla Sinew is a rare drop
T 196 @ Stranglethorn Vale, 35.7, 10.8 | Ride north to Hemet Nesingwary. Skip the next part (Tethis, elite)
H Booty Bay | Hearthstone, or cast Astral Recall. Both on cooldown? Ride back to Grom'gol and fly

# ---------- Booty Bay and the pirate ships ----------
T 609 | "Sea Wolf" MacKinley. Skip the next part (613, elite)
T 600,621 | Crank Fizzlebub
T 209 | Kebok
C 608,576 | The three Bloodsail ships lie at anchor off the coast south of Booty Bay. Swim out and clear the deckhands and sea dogs (43-45) near each captain one pull at a time, then kill Captain Stillwater (45-46, east ship), Captain Keelhaul (46-47, west ship) and Fleet Master Firallon (48, south ship). Still no Dizzy's Eye? Any ship crew can drop it. Stoneclaw Totem for adds, Healing Wave when low
A 624 @ Stranglethorn Vale, 29.2, 88.6 | Optional, before you swim back: Cortello's Riddle, a scroll lying on one of the ship decks. Loot it and right-click it. You hand it in under a bridge in the Swamp of Sorrows right after you reach Stonard; skip both steps if you did not find it
T 608 | Fleet Master Seahorn
T 576 | Dizzy One-Eye, a few steps from Seahorn

