FLY Stonard | Gringer (via Grom'gol)
S Stonard @ Swamp of Sorrows, 45.2, 56.7 | Innkeeper Karakul. Your hearthstone stays here into the next segment
TRAIN @ Swamp of Sorrows, 48.2, 57.9 | Haromm in Stonard, the only shaman trainer in the Eastern Kingdoms. Learn your level 46 spells, and 48 if you have it
