# ---------- Misty Reed Post ----------
T 698 @ Swamp of Sorrows, 81.3, 81.0 | Ride back east past Stonard to the coast, then south along the beach to Tok'Kar at Misty Reed Post. Kill every Monstrous Crawler (43-44) you pass: their legs for Fresh Meat (1430) drop only rarely
A 699 @ Swamp of Sorrows, 81.3, 81.0 | Tok'Kar
C 699 @ Swamp of Sorrows, 78.0, 97.5 | Sawtooth Snappers in the shallows along the south coast, south of the camp: claws drop on most kills. Two more crawlers walk this shore. Short of snappers? More of them live along the east coast
