# ---------- Badlands: Lotwil's bracers and Broken Alliances ----------
FLY Kargath | Breyk, Stonard's wind rider master
A 782 @ Badlands, 2.9, 45.6 | Gorn in Kargath
C 712 @ Badlands, 4.1, 79.6 | Ride south to the far south-west corner of the Badlands: Greater Rock Elementals (42-44) drop Bracers of Rock Binding on most kills. The Dustbelcher ogre camp (Camp Boff) sits between this group and a second one to the south-east, so pull from the edges and do not drift into the ogres. Kill Boss Tho'grun (next step) if he walks past
C 782 @ Badlands, 12.6, 75.5 | Boss Tho'grun (41-42, not elite) starts at Camp Boff and walks a long loop east along the southern road and back. Catch him on the road, away from the Maulers and Shamans in the camp, and loot the Sign of the Earth
T 712 @ Badlands, 25.9, 44.9 | Lotwil Veriatus at his camp in western Badlands. His and Lucien Tosselwrench's other quests need Auction House parts: skip them
T 782 @ Badlands, 2.9, 45.6 | Gorn, back in Kargath. Skip the next part (793, elite)

# ---------- Searing Gorge ----------
N Take the trail that starts just north of Kargath and climbs into Searing Gorge, then cross the gorge north-west to the Cauldron
A 3441 | Kalaran Windblade, at the north-west edge of the Cauldron
T 3441 | Listen to his story
A 3442
F Thorium Point @ Searing Gorge, 34.8, 30.8 | Grisha, the Horde wind rider master at Thorium Point, a short ride north-west
A 7728,7729 | The Wanted board at Thorium Point. Skip WANTED: Overseer Maltorius (elite)
A 7723,7724,7727 | Hansel Heavyhands
A 7722 | Master Smith Burninate
C 3442,7723 @ Searing Gorge, 42.0, 50.0 | Heavy War Golems (47-49) walk around the Cauldron and drop Golem Oil: kill 20. Blazing, Inferno and Magma Elementals in and around the Cauldron drop Hearts of Flame (Magma Elementals can drop both). Fire spells and fire totems do little to the elementals: use Frost Shock, Earth Shock and melee
T 3442 | Back to Kalaran Windblade
A 3443
C 7729,3443,7728:1 | Dark Iron Taskmasters and Slavers on the Cauldron floor. Any Dark Iron dwarf can drop a Thorium Plated Dagger. The Smithing Tuyere drops from the Dark Iron Steamsmiths at the forges on the west side of the Cauldron (40, 49). Keep the Grimesilt Outhouse Key if one drops
C 7727,7722 | The Slag Pit is a tunnel that leads down from the Cauldron floor. Incendosaurs fill its lava pools: kill your 20 first. The Secret Plans: Fiery Flux lie on the ground at 40.5, 35.7, right beside Overseer Maltorius (elite 50) and his two elite Dark Iron Sentries (48). Do not try to clear them: come in from the side away from them, click the plans and walk straight back up the tunnel, with an Earthbind Totem behind you if one turns
C 7724 @ Searing Gorge, 28.0, 44.0 | Spiders first, on the west plateau south-west of Thorium Point: almost all Greater Lava Spiders (47-49) live there and in its lava pools, from 27, 38 south to 22-31, 66-78. Work south through them until you have killed 20. Still short? A few more roam south of the towers at 40, 69 and 44, 68
C 7728:2 @ Searing Gorge, 33.2, 53.5 | Now the sentry towers south of the Cauldron, west to east (33, 54; 36, 61; 43, 63; 50-54, 56-59): Dark Iron Lookouts there drop the Lookout's Spyglass. An elite Dark Iron Sentry (48) guards each tower: pull the Lookouts away from it with Lightning Bolt (the group at 53, 59 stands furthest from its Sentry). The east tower is a short ride from the outhouse, your next stop
A 4449 @ Searing Gorge, 65.6, 62.2 | Ride east from the last tower to the Wooden Outhouse at the Grimesilt Dig Site and talk to it. Leave Ledger from Tanaris alone afterwards: its items are in Dustwallow and the Swamp of Sorrows
C 4449 @ Searing Gorge, 63.3, 60.5 | Five Dark Iron Geologists dig right next to the outhouse; the other three work at 69, 33, far to the north. Kill the five here, then wait a few minutes for them to come back rather than riding north. Dark Iron Watchmen stand among them. You also need 15 Silk Cloth
T 4449 @ Searing Gorge, 65.6, 62.2 | The outhouse
A 4451 @ Searing Gorge, 65.6, 62.2 | Right-click the Grimesilt Outhouse Key. No key yet? Any Dark Iron Taskmaster, Slaver or Lookout can drop it: the nearest stand at 58, 42, north-west of the dig site. Skip this pair if it will not drop
T 4451 @ Searing Gorge, 65.6, 62.2 | Use the key on the outhouse door
T 3443 | Ride back north-west to Kalaran Windblade. Skip The Flame's Casing (elite)
T 7729,7728 | Taskmaster Scrange, Thorium Point
T 7723,7724,7727 | Hansel Heavyhands
T 7722 | Master Smith Burninate
L 49 @ Searing Gorge, 31.0, 45.0 | Quest XP runs short here, so grind to 49 before the next segment. Kill the level 47-49 mobs: Greater Lava Spiders on the west plateau (27-32, 37-50), and Heavy War Golems and Dark Iron Taskmasters along the west rim of the Cauldron (34-38, 41-48). The level 45-46 Slavers give less XP. Skip the elite Dark Iron Sentries at the towers (34, 54 is the closest) and beside Maltorius
N Ride back to Thorium Point: the next segment starts at Grisha with a flight to the Undercity | Keep 864 (Undercity), 650 and 2641 (Hinterlands) and 32 (Orgrimmar). Your hearthstone is set to Stonard
